WEBVTT

00:04:29.724 --> 00:04:31.434
to become politically involved.

00:04:31.851 --> 00:04:35.688
We discuss a lot of different issues
like education equity,

00:04:35.688 --> 00:04:38.316
voter suppression, racial justice.

00:04:38.357 --> 00:04:41.444
And I've seen some amazing things happen

00:04:41.485 --> 00:04:44.613
when people just talk to one another.

00:04:44.613 --> 00:04:48.034
Understanding and accepting
of our differences.

00:04:48.701 --> 00:04:52.455
I actually remember this one conversation
in the summer of 2020.

00:04:52.913 --> 00:04:55.833
There was a boy and a girl
who were debating

00:04:55.875 --> 00:04:58.127
the merit of the Black Lives
Matter movement.

00:04:58.169 --> 00:05:00.046
And I remember being afraid